Fri Oct 30 20:34:43 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 8.0.0
  * release v8.0.0 following hashcat v8.0.0
  * support of WPA-FT-PSK.
  * the new hash file is not(!) backwards compatible with hashcat
    before commit hashcat/hashcat@6847f77.
  * due to new hash lines WPA3 and WPA4 and new EAPOL limits.

