Wed Nov  1 19:47:32 UTC 2023 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 6.3.2
  * added simple pattern generator based on analysis of wpa-sec
  * added -Wpedantic to compiler flags and fixed all warnings
  * added several new weak candidates based on analysis of wpa-sec
  * fixed some bugs
- Update to version 6.3.2
  * new options
  * new weak candidates
  * several bug fixes and improvements
- Update to version 6.3.1
  * do not overwrite oui.txt in case of download ERROR
  * fixed several bugs
  * fixed several typos
- Update to version 6.3.0
  * Completely refactored.
  * Improved scan engine.
  * Improved detection of EAPOL/EAP messages.
  * Moved from to pselect() to epoll().
  * Use timerfd() instead of counters.
  * Changed several options.
  * Removed all options and code that make hcxdumptool sluggish.
  * Moved to RTNETLINK an NL80211 protocol.
  * Removed entire WEXT code, because it is marked as deprecated
    since Linux kernel 6.3.0.
  * New real time status display instead of waterfall display.

